2
00:19:28,421 --> 00:19:34,421
Hogfather is a fantasy, tv movie film directed by Vadim Jean.

3
00:29:12,631 --> 00:29:18,631
It's the night before Hogswatch, usually a time of joy on Discworld, but there
are suspicious going-on and the criminal underworld is abuzz.

4
00:38:56,842 --> 00:39:02,842
The beloved Hogfather - the jolly bearer of glee and
pork-related gifts for children everywhere - has vanished.

5
00:48:41,052 --> 00:48:47,052
Suddenly, Discworld's entire mythical system is under threat.

6
00:58:25,263 --> 00:58:31,263
The fate of this magical time rests in the hands of a very motley group: A band of wizards headed up by a mystical university president named Mustrum Ridcully (Joss Ackland), a loyal
manservant called Albert (David Jason), a level-headed governess called Susan Sto Heilt (Michelle Dockery), and her grandfather, who happens to be - Death (Marnix van den Broeke).

7
01:08:09,473 --> 01:08:15,473
Albert, played by David Jason.

8
